sp; freq &amp;gt; 0 : x tick / run ; &amp;lt; 0 tick each x run&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; abstract void tick();&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; int freq, rcnt = 0, tcnt ; bool actif&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; void run() : if !actif return&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; rcnt--, if rcnt &amp;lt; freq : rcnt = 0, tcnt = freq,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; while tcnt &amp;gt; 0 &amp;amp; actif : tick(), tcnt--&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; FRAME THREADS :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Main process : render loop, daemon top&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Frame process : main start them each frame after all have ended prev frame exec, store duration of execution of each&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Utl metode :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;static void wait_until(Condition c, int delay)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;while ( !c.test()) Thread.sleep(delay)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;class MainProcess&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Array&amp;lt;FrameProcess&amp;gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; void render() : run execframe all process&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;abst class FrameProcess extends Thread :&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; abstract frame()&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; private bool ready ; sync bool isReady()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; void run() : ready=0 &amp;gt; frame() &amp;gt; ready=1&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; sync void execframe() :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;wait_until(() -&amp;gt; boolean { &amp;gt; ready }, 1) &amp;gt; start&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;------------------------------------------&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;GL&amp;nbsp; IMPLEMENT&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;------------------------------------------&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;FAST GL COMMAND EXECUTOR&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;final int ARG = 4 int : codeId, arg1, 2, 3&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;final int SYM = 32 Symbole = 1 word&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;final int WORD = 128 word = 1 sheet&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;final int SHEET = 2 sheet = in/out buffer&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; SHEET * WORD * SYM * ARG = 2^15&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;class CodeSheet : int[2][WORD*SYM*ARG]&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;class GLExecutor :&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Handle launching of gl commands to form a frame following a code&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; As a twinbuff to thread guard com input&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Twin&amp;lt;int[]&amp;gt; coms : arrays are dynamic&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; void exec(int[] cm)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; void word() loop SYM sym()&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; void symb() : switch case &amp;gt; metode&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; + All Gl metode&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;GL RENDERING CORE :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;GLRenderer : All GL metode :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;ClearScreen (array id, val index) : copy 4 flt from array starting at val index &amp;gt; clear color&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;BeginBuffer (int buff id) / endBuffer()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;BindBuff(int buff id, bind id)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;BindText(int text id, bind id)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;BlendSrc(int src_color/alpha)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;BlendDst(int dist_color/alpha)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;BindShader(int shader id)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;UniformFlt(unif id, array id, val index) : set val of common float uniform, copy unif.valnb flt from array starting at val index&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;UniformInt(unif id, val id, val)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;RenderScreen() : render screen mesh&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;BindBatch(int batch id)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;BindVertices(int vert id)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Begin/FlushBatch() : batch.begin/flush()&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;PushMesh() : binded batch.pushMesh()&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;PushVertex/Indice/Inst(int start, len) :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; binded Vertices flt[] &amp;gt; binded Batch&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;RenderBatch(int start mesh, int start offset, int nb to render)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;GL_Code :&amp;nbsp; x20&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Arg = 0 x5 :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;BeginBatch ; FlushBatch ; PushMesh ; RenderScreen ; EndBuffer&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Arg = 1 int x4 :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;BindShader ; BindBatch ; BindVertices ; BeginBuffer&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Arg = 2 int x8 :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;BindBuffer ; BindTexture ; PushVertice ; PushIndice ; PushInst ; ClearScreen ; BlendSrc ; BlendDst&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Arg = 3 int x3 :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;RenderBatch ; UniformInt ; UniformFlt&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; GL OBJECT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;GLClass : final, registered by int : Buffer, Texture, Arrays, Shader, Uniform, Batch&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;GLObj : final, instances of, registered by int&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;For finding gl objects (batch, shader, ... ) use base ARRAY pop after making all objs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; T[] gl_T_list : int gl_obj_id -&amp;gt; T t&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;class Buffer : vfxbuffer&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;class Texture : texture object&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;class FloatARRAY : float buffer, dynamic&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;class ShortARRAY : short buffer, dynamic&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;class Uniform : common uniform val&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; flt[4] fval, int[4] ival ; bool isflt ; int valnb&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;SetView(flt x, y, w, h), SetCam(flt x, y, r, s), SetMask(flt x, y, w, h) &amp;gt; common uniforms&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;class SHADER : ShaderProgram,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; define : uniforms for vertex / frag shader&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; some uniforms are common ;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; varying variables ; MeshAttribute ;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; vert/frag shader main() instruct⁰ text&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;func for sequancial add of lines&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;gt; Use definitions to write shaders progs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; autobind uniforms after shader bind&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;static class MeshAttribute :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Shared by Batch and Shader&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Vert nb, indice nb, inst nb&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; VertAttributeDefs, InstAttributeDefs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;class BATCH : registered Batched Mesh&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Define MeshAttribute&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; int vert_cnt, ind_cnt, inst_cnt, mech_cnt&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; void begin() all_cnt = 0&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; void pushMesh() : flush() &amp;gt; next mesh&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; void pushVert/Ind/Inst : to tmp arrays&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; void flush() current_mesh.set(tmp vert, ind, inst) &amp;gt; vert/ind/inst_cnt = 0&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; void render(Shader) : render used meshs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-----------------------------------------------------&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;ALL&amp;nbsp; VALIDE / NEEDED&amp;nbsp; THINGS&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-----------------------------------------------------&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;abstract class System implement Module&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Annot + Helper to add : toolbox element / svalue / global metode (console script) / global setting (script &amp;lt;&amp;gt; val) / Config param / broadcast channel - listener / event or task callback stack - Callable obj&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;PROJECT TOOL :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; File global Config + texts (use T.t(..))&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Utl : const, calc, cast, algo, register&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Primitive map : class / id / texts / metodes (new, to/from str/byte[], copy, script blocs) (int float bool byte str vec)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Unique int/byte code, map name as str&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Extend Run, multifonction field (arg/inst)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Signal channel : listen / broadcast&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Task stack (add/remove/runEventX)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Thread pool : minithread, callbackthread, synced thread, twin buffer, object locking&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Modding friendly structure : interface to implement to be loaded at startup, one front class to access all, limited Types, comment code, only used code&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; logging (to file, error()),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; exception catching + exception origin bypass&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Module (pSystem) : load, map&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Task management (frame event, delayed event)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Threading : main thread, synced thread (twin buffer), task minithread&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; File : access asset / exec folders, list files, create read write file (string / byte)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Asset manager : background load&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Data bloc save/load (byte &amp;gt; fast)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;GAME&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Game Rendering : TileMap, TileSet ; Fx Render (Aura, Solid, Color, Light) ; Shape Batching ; UI Rendering&amp;nbsp; (debug line) ; Space render Buffer ( frame light deco)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Box2d : Body (dynamic / static / sensor), Joint, Shape/Raycast (filter, lighting, visibility, detection)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Game Entity : Solide (physic, shape, fx, force, collision) ; Dynamic (bullet, ray, wave, particle) ; Map(dirt void wall light spawn)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Game Manager : ECS ; Standard / Pooled instance ; tick ; global metodes ; base standard (ref geom..)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Scripting : Node (widg table, link/co) ; Tile (script bloc) Game node (asset blueprint)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; APPLET&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Project :&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; File global Config + texts (use T.t(..))&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Utl : const, calc, cast, algo, register&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Primitive prop map : class / id / texts / metodes (new, to/from str/byte[], copy, script blocs)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Unique int/byte code, map name as str&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Extend Run, multifonction field (arg/inst)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Signal channel : listen / broadcast&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Task stack (add/remove/runEventX)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Thread pool : minithread, callbackthread, synced thread, twin buffer, locking&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Modding friendly structure : interface to implement to be loaded at startup, one front class to access all, limited Types, comment code, only used code&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Deploy : lwjgl3 / construo / steampipe&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Applet :&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Title screen (new / load), Game screen&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Fullscreen, window, resize, hide/show, title, logo, cursor, loading screen, logging (to file, error()), exception catching + exception origin bypass&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Module (pSystem) : load, map&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; App startup (static build), dispose at exit&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Render loop, input listening, Task management (frame event, delayed event)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Threading : main thread, synced thread (twin buffer), task minithread&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; File : access asset / exec folders, list files, create read write file (string / byte)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Asset manager : background load&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Common GUI, gui state saving, ingame console, debug drawing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Data bloc save/load (byte &amp;gt; fast)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;UI :&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Widget : label, trigg, switch, field, slide&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Custom widget drawer&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Group : Table (col / row / section), List (scroll, bar, mask, picker, tree), Window (head (can hide), grab, collapse),&amp;nbsp; ViewSpace (camera (pos zoom rot), resizable window, wallpaper, background grid, frontground UI)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;GUI building helper (nInstance)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;App GUI : collapsable menubar, debug text, pop window, dropmenu&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Game GUI : toolbox, script / space views&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;GAME DETAILS :&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Game Rendering :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;TileMap, TileSet : load / render / modif&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Fx Render : Aura, Solid, Color, Light&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Shape Batching : polygon, outline, shadow&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;halo, bullet, ray, wave, particle, lights&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;UI Rendering : world debug, line drawing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Space render Buffer : frame (tile aura shape), light (color light vision), background / foreground deco (reuse)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&l